  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>An electron will be emitted only when the frequency of light is more than the threshold frequency. As the frequency increases, K.E will increase linearly. The graph will be a straight line not passing through origin hence this is not a correct representation. So, this is the correct option.<br /><img height=\"189\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9a062e0e-91cc-4db7-b5d4-ff57f0c51312-image.png\" width=\"213\" /><br />The number of emitted&nbsp;electrons will depend upon the number of the photons but not on the energy and frequency of the photons.</p>",
